# Keep the Docker build context small and avoid shipping stale/generated
# artifacts into the image. Only balancer/, paper/, evaluation/, training/,
# data/, Makefile, and env.yaml are COPYed by the Dockerfile — everything
# below is either never copied anyway (safety net for future Dockerfile
# changes) or is a generated artifact that should be rebuilt fresh inside
# the container rather than baked in stale.

# VCS
.git
.git/lfs

# Not needed inside the image / not COPYed by the Dockerfile
website/
output/
.claude
scratchpad/

# Generated / stale artifacts — regenerated fresh by `make figures`,
# `make eval-sim`, `make paper`, `make supplementary`, etc.
evaluation/results/
paper/ram/*.pdf
paper/ram/supplementary/*.pdf

# Caches, logs, OS cruft
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.log
.DS_Store
